READING GUIDE
 - Oracle% is the best achievable CR at each horizon (perfect prediction).
 - If Oracle% ~ S2% at short horizon, prediction has NO leverage there
   (authority-bound). If Oracle% << S2% at long horizon, better prediction
   WOULD reduce conflicts -> prediction regains leverage with lead time.
 - 'prediction-limited' fraction = share of PlanGrad conflicts an oracle
   predictor would have avoided at that detection horizon.
